{"id":"n48583-1-12","stage":1,"title":"돈가스 · 韩式炸猪排","scene":"餐饮与生活","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n48583-1-12-1","ko":"여보! 돈가스는 다 튀겼어요.","zh":"亲爱的！炸猪排已经全部炸好啦。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"여보!","meaning":"喂，老婆，老公","explanation":"여보：喂，老婆，老公","readings":[{"term":"여보","audio":"/audio/7809541ae162d432b91a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58165","senseId":"1","lemma":"여보","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"돈가스는","meaning":"韩式炸猪排","explanation":"돈가스：韩式炸猪排；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"돈가스","audio":"/audio/49f71795878caf1df342.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"48583","senseId":"1","lemma":"돈가스","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다","meaning":"全，都","explanation":"다：全，都","readings":[{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58175","senseId":"1","lemma":"다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"튀겼어요.","meaning":"油炸，炸，煎","explanation":"튀기다：油炸，炸，煎；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"튀기다","audio":"/audio/1c33040a09d4e952ea01.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82380","senseId":"1","lemma":"튀기다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"7809541ae162d432","term":"여보","zh":"喂，老婆，老公","audio":"/audio/7809541ae162d432b91a.mp3","entryId":"58165","definition":"夫妇之间的称谓。","pronunciation":["여보"]},{"id":"49f71795878caf1d","term":"돈가스","zh":"韩式炸猪排","audio":"/audio/49f71795878caf1df342.mp3","entryId":"48583","definition":"把稍厚的猪肉放入调料腌制后沾上面包粉，再油炸而成的食物。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"822b7db6f6886f57","term":"다","zh":"全，都","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3","entryId":"58175","definition":"无剩余或遗漏，所有的。","pronunciation":["다ː"]},{"id":"1c33040a09d4e952","term":"튀기다","zh":"油炸，炸，煎","audio":"/audio/1c33040a09d4e952ea01.mp3","entryId":"82380","definition":"放入热油中使食物胀起来。","pronunciation":["튀기다"]}],"audio":"/audio/94c645efa106067b67f3.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n48583-1-12-2","ko":"그럼 기름을 잘 뺀 뒤 소스와 함께 내세요.","zh":"那请把油充分沥干后，再连同酱汁一起端上来。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그럼","meaning":"那么，既然那样","explanation":"그럼：那么，既然那样","readings":[{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60346","senseId":"2","lemma":"그럼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"기름을","meaning":"油","explanation":"기름：油；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"기름","audio":"/audio/14b26cab577adc333256.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"40022","senseId":"1","lemma":"기름","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잘","meaning":"好好地，顺利地","explanation":"잘：好好地，顺利地","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"4","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"뺀","meaning":"放，排，泄","explanation":"빼다：放，排，泄；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"빼다","audio":"/audio/2a9a5583b5aa17960d82.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"85714","senseId":"6","lemma":"빼다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"뒤","meaning":"之后，下一个，接下来","explanation":"뒤：之后，下一个，接下来","readings":[{"term":"뒤","audio":"/audio/c65326b2de936236c222.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67477","senseId":"5","lemma":"뒤","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"소스와","meaning":"酱汁，调味汁","explanation":"소스：酱汁，调味汁；와：连接共同参与或比较的对象，常表示“和、与”；结合句中动作理解。","readings":[{"term":"소스","audio":"/audio/ffa449b1814256e31b76.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"63626","senseId":"1","lemma":"소스","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"함께","meaning":"一起，共同，与共","explanation":"함께：一起，共同，与共","readings":[{"term":"함께","audio":"/audio/6d2b6bbf82785e6dce3d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72465","senseId":"1","lemma":"함께","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"내세요.","meaning":"端出，摆出","explanation":"내다：端出，摆出；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"내다","audio":"/audio/3c7ab23f77767092623c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89906","senseId":"16","lemma":"내다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"86f87d3fb9919f14","term":"그럼","zh":"那么，既然那样","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3","entryId":"60346","definition":"用于表示接受前文内容，或以前文为基础，提出新的主张。","pronunciation":["그럼"]},{"id":"14b26cab577adc33","term":"기름","zh":"油","audio":"/audio/14b26cab577adc333256.mp3","entryId":"40022","definition":"易燃、不溶水的滑润的液体。","pronunciation":["기름"]},{"id":"8aff11a4aebdccdb","term":"잘","zh":"好好地，顺利地","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3","entryId":"58939","definition":"没有任何问题而舒服地。","pronunciation":["잘"]},{"id":"2a9a5583b5aa1796","term":"빼다","zh":"放，排，泄","audio":"/audio/2a9a5583b5aa17960d82.mp3","entryId":"85714","definition":"将某场所内的空气、水或气体等向外导出。","pronunciation":["빼ː다"]},{"id":"c65326b2de936236","term":"뒤","zh":"之后，下一个，接下来","audio":"/audio/c65326b2de936236c222.mp3","entryId":"67477","definition":"接着前一个。","pronunciation":["뒤ː"]},{"id":"ffa449b1814256e3","term":"소스","zh":"酱汁，调味汁","audio":"/audio/ffa449b1814256e31b76.mp3","entryId":"63626","definition":"放在食物里，增加色香味的液体。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"6d2b6bbf82785e6d","term":"함께","zh":"一起，共同，与共","audio":"/audio/6d2b6bbf82785e6dce3d.mp3","entryId":"72465","definition":"许多人一下子同时。","pronunciation":["함께"]},{"id":"3c7ab23f77767092","term":"내다","zh":"端出，摆出","audio":"/audio/3c7ab23f77767092623c.mp3","entryId":"89906","definition":"为招待客人，拿出饮食。","pronunciation":["내ː다"]}],"audio":"/audio/684dbdc9c54eb6cd1a7a.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.277,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=48583","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":44,"sequenceScore":1.9304,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["那请把油充分沥干后，再连同酱汁一起端上来。","亲爱的！炸猪排已经全部炸好啦。","我是来提交文件的。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["亲爱的！炸猪排已经全部炸好啦。","我是来提交文件的。","那请把油充分沥干后，再连同酱汁一起端上来。"],"answer":2}]}
